deffer -----| RT_1		=	norm.mid		|--decompress---| RT_N	= norm.mid,	4xFP16		|--accumulate---| RT_ACCUM = total_light	|--combine
			| RT_COLOR	=	rgb.gloss		|				\-------------------------------/				\---------------------------/
			| RT_ACCUM	=	hemi+emissive	|				
